WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.479 --> 00:00:02.280
How can I remain silent,

00:00:03.839 --> 00:00:06.239
when what we have seen for over 15 years,

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:13.239
not even a surgeon can get used to?

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.000
How can I remain silent,

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.159
when we know that these crimes against humanity

00:00:19.759 --> 00:00:24.439
have been planned with a purely economic motive?

00:00:30.079 --> 00:00:33.800
There are few days when the news in my region

00:00:34.319 --> 00:00:37.600
isn't linked to a new human tragedy.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:43.720
Last week, more than 50 people were massacred

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:48.000
with machetes in Beni territory, North Kivu.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.839
Pregnant women are cut open

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.319
and babies mutilated.

00:00:55.119 --> 00:00:59.119
Women's bodies have become a real battlefield

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:02.400
and rape is used as a weapon of war.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.879
Even a single case of rape is serious

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:11.039
and requires action from all of us.

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:12.600
In my country,

00:01:12.959 --> 00:01:15.759
hundreds of thousands of women have been raped.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.839
I think of every woman who has been raped

00:01:18.839 --> 00:01:22.920
as my wife,

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.039
of every mother who has been raped

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.879
of every mother who has been raped

00:01:33.879 --> 00:01:36.000
as my mother,

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.759
 and of every child who has been raped

00:01:37.759 --> 00:01:40.280
as my children.

00:01:42.119 --> 00:01:44.560
In a world which has lost its values,

00:01:45.159 --> 00:01:50.720
where violence is trivialised with impunity,

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:55.680
refusing violence is to be a dissident.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.400
By drawing the world's attention

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:03.720
to the need to protect women during armed conflict,

00:02:04.159 --> 00:02:07.000
you have refused to remain indifferent

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:12.239
to one of the greatest humanitarian disasters of modern times.

00:02:12.759 --> 00:02:14.119
There can be neither peace

00:02:14.319 --> 00:02:17.319
nor economic and social progress

00:02:17.519 --> 00:02:19.879
without respect for human rights.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:24.000
Today, Europe is expressing its solidarity to us

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.519
loud and clear and in front of the whole world.

00:02:26.759 --> 00:02:29.519
It wants to walk with us in our quest

00:02:29.519 --> 00:02:32.839
for the restoration of a dignified Congolese life.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:37.039
Our country is sick,

00:02:37.639 --> 00:02:41.079
but together with our friends around the world

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:45.039
we can and we will heal it.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:47.639
Thank you.

